{"id":"a89fca2dc3b5b5cb","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-ackermann-function.md","title":"Ackermann Function","display":"df-ackermann-function — Ackermann Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-ackermann-function","aliases":["88-df-ackermann-function"],"display":"df-ackermann-function — Ackermann Function","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-ackermann-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-ackermann-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ackermann-function — Ackermann Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A: \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A: \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (Ackermann function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m, n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(m, n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (natural numbers)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ackermann\\text{-}function} \\vdash (1)\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(A(0,n)=n+1) \\;\\land\\; (2)\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(A(m+1,0)=A(m,1)) \\;\\land\\; (3)\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(A(m+1,n+1)=A(m,A(m+1,n)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ackermann\\text{-}function} \\vdash (1)\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(A(0,n)=n+1) \\;\\land\\; (2)\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(A(m+1,0)=A(m,1)) \\;\\land\\; (3)\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(A(m+1,n+1)=A(m,A(m+1,n)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(m, n)\">\\(A(m, n)\\)</span> : Ackermann函数</li>\n<li>Ackermann函数是总递归但非原始递归的典型例子</li>\n<li>每个一元原始递归函数最终都被某个适当的 Ackermann 切片支配；\n该说法不把二元函数与任意元数函数作无类型的“增长速度”比较。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"A: \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"m, n \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ackermann\\text{-}function} \\vdash (1)\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(A(0,n)=n+1) \\;\\land\\; (2)\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(A(m+1,0)=A(m,1)) \\;\\land\\; (3)\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(A(m+1,n+1)=A(m,A(m+1,n)))","display":true},{"tex":"A(m, n)","display":false}],"bytes":941,"backlinks":[{"id":"ae09a46ca7006ab7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$A$ 固定为 [[88-df-ackermann-function]] 的三条递归方程所确定的函数，而非任意 $\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 函数。"},{"id":"8ec266922d674ea7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ (Ackermann function, see [[88-df-ackermann-function]])"},{"id":"aabd59bbace390a1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A$ (Ackermann function, see [[88-df-ackermann-function]])"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md